  "criterion": "Admit Target119 u20928 only as one complete SDK control-schema initializer: all seven owner-added rows must be partitioned between six exact Target118 replay-authenticated schema fields and the sole Target119 forwardSubagentText schema endpoint, whose complete 16-occurrence runtime graph is pinned. Incidental schema property text and partial source replay are insufficient.",
